<h4 id=3D"KafkaProducerandKafdropSetup-KafDroptoolsetup"><strong>KafDrop to=
ol setup</strong></h4>
<p><strong>View messages using Kafdrop tool 'acf_migration_notifications' (=
for testing purposes):</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Get kafdrop (download jar file for local setup):</strong></li>
</ul>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/obsidiandynamics/k=
afdrop" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/obsidiandynamics/kafdrop</a></p=
>
<p>Direct Link use 4.0.2 version : <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://github.com/obsidiandynamics/kafdrop/releases/download/4.0.2/kafdrop-4.0.=
2.jar" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/obsidiandynamics/kafdrop/release=
s/download/4.0.2/kafdrop-4.0.2.jar</a>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Create kafka.properties file in the same folder as the jar:</st=
rong></li>
</ul>
<p>Copy the following in the properties file</p>
<p><span style=3D"color: rgb(204,204,204);">bootstrap.servers=3D</span><spa=
n style=3D"color: rgb(206,145,120);"><a href=3D"http://cl001.eastus2.uat.ie=
bus.3pc.att.com" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">cl001.eastus2.uat=
.iebus.3pc.att.com</a>:9093</span><br><span style=3D"color: rgb(204,204,204=
);"><a href=3D"http://group.id" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">gr=
oup.id</a>=3D</span><span style=3D"color: rgb(206,145,120);">IdentityGraph-=
stage-group</span><br><span style=3D"color: rgb(204,204,204);">security.pro=
tocol=3D</span><span style=3D"color: rgb(206,145,120);">SASL_SSL</span><br>=
<span style=3D"color: rgb(204,204,204);">sasl.mechanism=3D</span><span styl=
e=3D"color: rgb(206,145,120);">PLAIN</span><br><span style=3D"color: rgb(20=
4,204,204);">sasl.jaas.config=3D</span><span style=3D"color: rgb(206,145,12=
0);">org.apache.kafka.common.security.plain.PlainLoginModule required usern=
ame=3D"&lt;user-name&gt;" password=3D"&lt;password-from-idgraph-team&gt;";<=
/span></p>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Run the following command to start Kafdrop(for local setup):</s=
trong></li>
</ul>
